| DCN | Unseen | 0.69174 | 0.79680 | 108/192 |
| DCN-v2 | Seen | 0.68399 | 0.54227 | 164/224 |
| DCN-v2 | Unseen | 0.68194 | 0.64296 | 121/192 |

